  <section id="wg-steering" aria-labelledby="wg-steering-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="wg-steering-title" class="mgdb-panel-title">Steering Committee</h2></div>
    </div>

    <p class="wg-lede">The move from MaizeDB to MaizeGDB was guided by a ten-person steering committee drawn from the maize community and beyond, chosen for broad-based expertise to give the project its overall direction. The Working Group above continued its work.</p>

    <ul class="wg-roster wg-roster-detailed">
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=103840">Ed Buckler</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">USDA/ARS at Cornell University, Ithaca, NY</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=16059">Vicki Chandler</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">University of Arizona, Tucson, AZ</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=12887">Mike Freeling</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">Department of Plant Biology, UC Berkeley, Berkeley, CA</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=12904">Sarah Hake</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">USDA/ARS Plant Gene Expression Center, Albany, CA</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=16635">Mary Polacco</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">USDA/ARS at the University of Missouri, Columbia, MO</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=13016">Marty Sachs</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">USDA/ARS Soybean/Maize Germplasm, Pathology, and Genetics Research Unit, Urbana, IL</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=200393">Tom Slezak</a> <span class="wg-role">Chair</span>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">Biology and Biotechnology Research Program, DOE Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory, Livermore, CA</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=275144">Cari Soderlund</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">Arizona Genomics Institute, University of Arizona, Tucson, AZ</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=172704">Lincoln Stein</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory, Cold Spring Harbor, NY</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/person?id=16906">Virginia Walbot</a>
        <span class="wg-affiliation">Department of Biological Sciences, Stanford University, Stanford, CA</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mgdb-note wg-note">Affiliations are as recorded while the committee served. Four of its ten members went on to the Working Group&#58; Ed Buckler, Mike Freeling, Marty Sachs and Tom Slezak, who chaired both bodies.</p>
  </section>

