    <p class="mgdb-note wg-note"><strong>Data note:</strong> every link in this table was checked on 5 September 2026. One entry has lost its target &#8212; the August 2013 status report &#8212; and keeps its title without a link, so the record still says the document existed. The agenda for that meeting is preserved separately as the <a href="/working_group2013">2013 Working Group meeting agenda</a>.</p>
